  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fc0\"><a style=\"color:#fc0\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hotdog-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看我的新模组：热狗盛宴！</a></span><br><br>需要 <span style=\"color:#9c0\">农夫<span style=\"color:#008000\">的</span> <span style=\"color:#808000\">美<span style=\"color:#030\">味</span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组是 <span style=\"color:#808000\"><strong>农夫的美味的附加模组</strong></span>，它使用来自<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>主世界</strong></span>、<strong><span style=\"color:#930\">下界</span></strong>、<span style=\"color:#800080\"><span style=\"color:#000\">和</span><strong>末地</strong></span>的<strong><span style=\"color:#9cf\">矿物</span></strong>与<strong><span style=\"color:#3cc\">各种宝石</span></strong>制作<strong><span style=\"color:#fc0\">食物</span></strong>。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">每种食材食用后都有独特的<strong><span style=\"color:#cfc\">效果</span></strong>。例如，如果食用含有<strong><span style=\"color:#c9f\">紫水晶</span></strong>作为食材的食物，它将赋予你'<span style=\"color:#c9f\"><strong>璀璨</strong></span>'状态效果，在该效果持续期间，当你造成<strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">暴击</span></strong>时获得<strong><span style=\"color:#ff9\">经验值</span></strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如需提供创意建议或<strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">报告错误</span></strong>，请加入我们的<strong><span style=\"color:#339\">Discord！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，本模组正在不断更新中，敬请期待！再次提醒，加入我们的 Discord 以查看更新进度并提出建议！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#c9f\">紫水晶-<strong>璀璨</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fc0\">金-<strong>吸收</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#0ff\">钻石-<strong>高贵</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800000\">红石-<strong>信号化</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#808080\">所有石头-<strong>抗性</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#339\"><a style=\"color:#339\" href=\"https://discord.gg/4ebsS4R2hN\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt;Discord 链接</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">看看我的另一个美味模组：奇异盛宴！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#396;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#396\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unusual-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt;奇异盛宴</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
